WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.058 --> 00:00:03.044
- So Mike, you get your first signing bonus,

00:00:03.044 --> 00:00:04.004
what'd you do with it?

00:00:04.004 --> 00:00:05.839
- [Vick] So in my mind, you know, I'm like, 

00:00:05.839 --> 00:00:07.340
we're gonna get $3 million.

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:09.884
So, you know, I talked to all my aunts, my mom,

00:00:09.884 --> 00:00:11.594
my sisters. Got everybody in a huddle

00:00:11.594 --> 00:00:12.887
and was, like, "Look, this the play.

00:00:12.887 --> 00:00:15.974
Aunt Tina, I'mma give you $50,000 and, you know,

00:00:15.974 --> 00:00:18.268
a nice GMC truck.

00:00:18.268 --> 00:00:20.562
Aunt Joyce, I'mma give you $100,000 and—."

00:00:20.562 --> 00:00:23.231
Mom was a given, you know, she was the jewel

00:00:23.231 --> 00:00:25.066
so she was gonna get whatever she wanted.

00:00:25.066 --> 00:00:26.276
Get the check. 

00:00:26.276 --> 00:00:28.486
So I open it up, and I look at it, and I just 

00:00:28.486 --> 00:00:30.054
look at my mom, and she lookin' like

00:00:30.054 --> 00:00:31.054
she thought it was a blank check

00:00:31.054 --> 00:00:32.407
or she thought it was a joke

00:00:32.407 --> 00:00:33.867
or we had been punked or something.

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:36.161
The check said $1.9 million.

00:00:36.161 --> 00:00:38.121
I'm like, "Uh-oh. Mom, we got a problem,

00:00:38.121 --> 00:00:40.582
Houston, we got a problem, for sure."

00:00:40.582 --> 00:00:41.958
- They took that much out?

00:00:41.958 --> 00:00:43.460
That GMC all of a sudden turned into a what?

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:45.184
- The GMC turned into, like, a Camaro.

00:00:45.184 --> 00:00:47.047
- [Laughing]

00:00:47.047 --> 00:00:48.465
- That was tougher than goin' to prison.

00:00:50.511 --> 00:00:52.638
Straight up. It's a lot of money.

00:00:53.303 --> 00:00:55.255
I wanted to kick myself in the ass, for real.

00:00:55.263 --> 00:00:56.720
- [Master laughing]

